<div class="section-head"><div><h2>Register a new product</h2><p>Add a product to the inventory catalogue. Product creation is restricted to the administrator.</p></div></div><div class="panel form-panel"><form id="productForm" class="form-grid"><label>SKU<input name="sku" required maxlength="60" placeholder="e.g. SKU-041"></label><label>Product name<input name="name" required maxlength="190" placeholder="Product name"></label><label>Category<select name="category_id" id="productCategory"><option value="">No category</option></select></label><label>Unit<input name="unit" value="pcs" maxlength="30" required></label><label>Reorder level<input name="reorder_level" type="number" min="0" value="10" required></label><label>Reorder quantity<input name="reorder_qty" type="number" min="0" value="20" required></label><label>Unit cost<input name="unit_cost" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" value="0.00" required></label><label>Preferred supplier<select name="preferred_supplier_id" id="productSupplier"><option value="">No preferred supplier</option></select></label><button class="btn primary" type="submit">Add product</button></form></div>
<div class="section-head"><div><h2>Create purchase order</h2><p>Order products from a supplier and track the order status.</p></div></div><div class="panel form-panel"><form id="purchaseForm" class="form-grid"><label>Product<select name="item_id" id="purchaseItem" required><option value="">Select product</option></select></label><label>Supplier<select name="supplier_id" id="purchaseSupplier" required><option value="">Select supplier</option></select></label><label>Quantity<input name="quantity" type="number" min="1" required></label><label>Unit cost<input name="unit_cost" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" required></label><label>Expected delivery<input name="expected_date" type="date"></label><label>Notes<input name="notes" maxlength="255" placeholder="Optional note"></label><button class="btn primary" type="submit">Place purchase order</button></form></div>
<div class="section-head"><div><h2>Purchase order history</h2><p>Track submitted orders and update their progress.</p></div></div><div class="panel"><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>ORDER</th><th>PRODUCT</th><th>SUPPLIER</th><th>QTY</th><th>UNIT COST</th><th>EXPECTED</th><th>STATUS</th><th>ACTION</th></tr></thead><tbody id="purchaseRows"><tr><td colspan="8" class="empty">Loading orders…</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>